{"status":"REVIEW","clause_id":"PAY-376abc005f079504f037","clause_number":"1.1.1","title":"1.1.1.非類固醇抗發炎劑外用製劑：(88/9/1、92/2/1、94/9/1、109/2/1)","source":{"key":"pay","label":"給付規定","status":"REVIEW","error":null,"indexed_nodes":6807,"tables":155,"source_name":"最新版藥品給付規定內容(整份帶走)-115.10.22更新","version":"2026-10-22","announcement_date":null,"page_updated_date":"2026-10-27","effective_date":null,"date_status":"待人工核實，未確認現行有效","verification_status":"REVIEW","pdf_url":"/documents/pay.pdf","pdf_sha256":"5bdd0292a73271c98f7f39afca6971b2bd8fbd4c78a697cd37f43ab78cd1414b"},"pdf_page_start":4,"pdf_page_end":4,"scope":"原始節點及既有子項；非人工驗證完整條文","verification_status":"REVIEW","human_verified":false,"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p000069","raw_text":"1.1.1.非類固醇抗發炎劑外用製劑：(88/9/1、92/2/1、94/9/1、109/2/1)","display_text":"1.1.1.非類固醇抗發炎劑外用製劑：(88/9/1、92/2/1、94/9/1、109/2/1)","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[69]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p000070","raw_text":"1.外用非類固醇抗發炎軟膏，不得同時併用口服或其他外用非類固醇抗發炎製劑，每4週至多以處方40gm為限(94/9/1、109/2/1)。","display_text":"1.外用非類固醇抗發炎軟膏，不得同時併用口服或其他外用非類固醇抗發炎製劑，每4週至多以處方40gm為限(94/9/1、109/2/1)。","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[70]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p000071","raw_text":"2.Flurbiprofen 40mg patch (如Flur Di Fen Patch)：","display_text":"2.Flurbiprofen 40mg patch (如Flur Di Fen Patch)：","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[71]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p000072","raw_text":"限同時符合下列條件之病患使用：(92/2/1、109/2/1)","display_text":"限同時符合下列條件之病患使用：(92/2/1、109/2/1)","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[72]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p000073","raw_text":"(1)單一關節（部位）或軟組織風濕症。","display_text":"(1)單一關節（部位）或軟組織風濕症。","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[73]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p000074","raw_text":"(2)不適合口服非類固醇抗發炎製劑者。","display_text":"(2)不適合口服非類固醇抗發炎製劑者。","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[74]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p000075","raw_text":"(3)不得同時併用口服或其他外用非類固醇抗發炎製劑，亦不得開立慢性連續處方箋(109/2/1)。","display_text":"(3)不得同時併用口服或其他外用非類固醇抗發炎製劑，亦不得開立慢性連續處方箋(109/2/1)。","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[75]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p000076","raw_text":"(4)每4週限處方16片以內(109/2/1)。","display_text":"(4)每4週限處方16片以內(109/2/1)。","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[76]"}],"ancestors":[{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p000066","raw_text":"第1節 神經系統藥物 Drugs acting on the nervous system","display_text":"第1節 神經系統藥物 Drugs acting on the nervous system","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[66]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p000068","raw_text":"1.1.疼痛解除劑 Drugs used for pain relief","display_text":"1.1.疼痛解除劑 Drugs used for pain relief","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[68]"}],"nested_tables":{},"references":[],"missing_source_paragraphs":[],"original_nodes":[{"clause_id":"PAY-376abc005f079504f037","clause_number":"1.1.1","parent_clause_id":"PAY-2cdd95eac80d894a1067","original_text":"1.1.1.非類固醇抗發炎劑外用製劑：(88/9/1、92/2/1、94/9/1、109/2/1)","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p000069"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-e07920e6328d141a9460","clause_number":"1.","parent_clause_id":"PAY-376abc005f079504f037","original_text":"1.外用非類固醇抗發炎軟膏，不得同時併用口服或其他外用非類固醇抗發炎製劑，每4週至多以處方40gm為限(94/9/1、109/2/1)。","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p000070"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-9ce1ae9824c1b9744f06","clause_number":"2.","parent_clause_id":"PAY-376abc005f079504f037","original_text":"2.Flurbiprofen 40mg patch (如Flur Di Fen Patch)：\n限同時符合下列條件之病患使用：(92/2/1、109/2/1)","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p000071","給付規定-p000072"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-937534a418febb3807e2","clause_number":"(1)","parent_clause_id":"PAY-9ce1ae9824c1b9744f06","original_text":"(1)單一關節（部位）或軟組織風濕症。","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p000073"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-edce1673d9de3f6458aa","clause_number":"(2)","parent_clause_id":"PAY-9ce1